BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 599.39 Td (1. High-Level Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 570.39 Td (The disease risk prediction system uses a layered architecture:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 541.89 Td (Mobile application) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 530.39 Td (  -> Backend application server) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 518.89 Td (  -> Machine learning service) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 507.39 Td (  -> Saved model artifacts) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 495.89 Td (  -> Database storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 472.39 Td (The mobile application collects user health values and displays the result. The backend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 455.89 Td (handles authentication, saved profile values, request preparation, prediction history, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 439.39 Td (chat history. The machine learning service loads the trained model and preprocessor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 422.89 Td (performs inference, and returns the prediction output.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 399.39 Td (The full prediction flow is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 370.89 Td (User enters health values) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 359.39 Td (-> Mobile app sends values to backend) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 347.89 Td (-> Backend merges new values with saved health profile) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 336.39 Td (-> Backend calculates helper values such as BMI) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 324.89 Td (-> Backend sends structured payload to ML service) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 313.39 Td (-> ML service preprocesses the payload) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 301.89 Td (-> Trained model predicts positive-class probability) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 290.39 Td (-> Probability is converted into Low, Medium, or High risk) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 278.89 Td (-> Explanation factors are generated) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 267.39 Td (-> Backend saves prediction result and input snapshot) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 255.89 Td (-> Mobile app displays risk level, confidence, factors, and summary) Tj ET
