BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 776.89 Td (19. Safety and Medical Boundaries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 747.89 Td (The system uses safety boundaries throughout the prediction and advice flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 724.39 Td (The disease prediction result is described as health awareness, not diagnosis.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 700.89 Td (The advice module does not prescribe treatment. It does not tell users to start, stop, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 684.39 Td (change medication. It recommends professional consultation when risk or readings may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 667.89 Td (high.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 644.39 Td (The standard safety note is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 615.89 Td (This is general health guidance, not a medical diagnosis.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 604.39 Td (It does not replace advice from a healthcare professional.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 571.89 Td (20. Final Technical Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 542.89 Td (The disease risk prediction system uses trained tabular machine learning models for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 526.39 Td (diabetes, stroke, and hypertension. Multiple algorithms were trained and compared using) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 509.89 Td (accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, ROC-AUC, and confusion matrix. Diabetes selected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 493.39 Td (XGBoost because it achieved the strongest overall performance. Stroke selected Logistic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 476.89 Td (Regression because recall was prioritized for a highly imbalanced screening task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 460.39 Td (Hypertension selected Logistic Regression because the dataset had label-quality limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 443.89 Td (and a simpler model was more appropriate.) Tj ET
